sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-turing-gray-scott> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-13-morphology-audit-turing-gray-scott-repro-package> .

